OL,3,GNEWSABBC Wales faces 'managed decline'
OL,4,Awithout more cash, MPs told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior BBC Cymru Wales executive has
OL,7,Fwarned MPs the broadcaster does not
OL,8,Fhave the money to make the content it
OL,9,Fis currently producing.
OL,11,FRhys Evans said that without reform to
OL,12,Fthe licence fee, the organisation had
OL,13,Ffaced an "inevitable path of continued
OL,14,Fand managed decline".
OL,16,FThe chief executive of Welsh language
OL,17,Fbroadcaster S4C, Geraint Evans, said
OL,18,Fthe future of broadcasting in Welsh was
OL,19,Fin "jeopardy" with resources stretched
OL,20,Fas the channel delivered programming on
OL,21,Fsocial media as well as television.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
