OL,3,GNEWSABBC Wales faces 'managed decline'
OL,4,Awithout more cash, MPs told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe TV licence fee - which funds BBC
OL,7,FCymru Wales and most of S4C - is
OL,8,Fcurrently up for review with ministers
OL,9,Fsaying they were considering new
OL,10,Ffunding models.
